      "statement": "The HX Eco-System is a 17-server native-Linux AI platform whose architecture is the cornerstone; validation proves the ecosystem and never defines it, so the correct dependency direction is FOUNDATION -> ECOSYSTEM SERVICES -> APPLICATION CAPABILITY -> VALIDATION and must not be inverted.",
